flowchart TD
    A[baseline.yaml] --> B[set_seed 42]
    B --> C[dataloaders_from_config<br/>train: crop+flip+normalise<br/>val: normalise only]
    C --> D[build_model → TinyCNN<br/>268,650 params]
    D --> E[optimizer SGD lr 0.05 mom 0.9<br/>scheduler cosine · loss CrossEntropy]
    E --> F[write run card<br/>outputs/logs/exp_config.md]
    F --> G{{for epoch 1..15}}
    G --> H[run_epoch TRAIN<br/>352 batches × 128<br/>forward → loss → backward → step]
    H --> I[run_epoch VAL<br/>40 batches · no grad · no step]
    I --> J[scheduler.step<br/>lr decays]
    J --> K[append CSV row<br/>epoch lr losses accs seconds]
    K --> L{val acc<br/>improved?}
    L -- yes --> M[save *_best.pt<br/>reset patience]
    L -- no --> N[patience += 1]
    M --> O[save *_last.pt]
    N --> O
    O --> P{patience ≥ 5<br/>or loss NaN?}
    P -- no --> G
    P -- yes --> Q[stop]
    G -- done --> Q
    Q --> R[best val acc · best epoch · paths]
